@page "/components/image-crop"
<PageTitle>Image Crop — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>
<h1 class="doc-h1">Image Crop</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">Drag and resize the Cropper.js selection. Apply emits <code>image-crop:apply</code> with a PNG data URL; reset restores it.</p>
<ImageCrop Src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531297484001-80022131f5a1?w=800&amp;q=60" Class="max-w-lg" />

<p>Aspect ratio is shown in the toolbar. Choose Free to resize width and height independently; fixed ratios intentionally link both dimensions.</p>
<p>Export also includes a Blob and source coordinates. Use the position and size fields with the keyboard; zoom buttons and Reset work without pointer gestures.</p>
